<title>SWEDEN: Electrolux shares up,Volvo flat.</title>
<headline>Electrolux shares up,Volvo flat.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish appliance maker Electrolux jumped at the open on Monday after the company announced its chief executive and president Leif Johansson was quitting to take over from Soren Gyll at AB Volvo .</p>
<p>Electrolux shares jumped nine crown to 435 crowns. Volvo shares were flat, slipping 0.5 crowns to 176.5 crowns.</p>
</text>
